# SMi Sentinel Core — fresh repository ignore rules
# Data, models and runtime artifacts live on disk, not in git.

# Runtime data (6.7 GB: library DBs, taxonomy stores, backups, archives)
data/
Logs/
logs/
sentinel_uploads/
ingest_status.json
*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Secrets & keys
1-run-key.txt
.env
*.key

# Local IDE / tool noise
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.gemini/
.continue/
New folder/

# OS noise
~$*
*.tmp
*.dmp
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Freebuff agent tool noise
.freebuff/

# §43 legacy purge: ETDP app REMOVED from the tree entirely; conversion venv
# (was left un-ignored by oversight) removed and its path ignored.
.venv-convert/

# NCBI PubMed API key (kept local; app reads it via pubmed_worker)
pubmedapi.md
# Owner's PubMed process notes (contains pasted third-party chat content - kept local by design)
pubmedprocess.md

# Live API key notes stay local-only (sanitized copies live in docs/)
app/apis/
sentinel/apis/

# Binary vector index
*.npy

# Owner-downloaded SWE-bench execution harness (132MB, third-party) - stays local like data/
assessments/swe-workbench/
.venv-ml/
engine/custom_engine_weights/

